  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the quality, policy relevance and access of agricultural  statistics in Sub-Saharan Africa by supporting the design and  implementation of nationally representative panel surveys, emphasizing  the production on a regular basis of detailed information on  agriculture and the rural economy.</narrative>
